# BFF — Availability alerts (M23-S06, UC-072, UC-076)
# CUSTOMER only (STAFF and MANAGER get 403). A pass-through to the backend: every ownership
# decision (own alerts only) is made there. An alert reserves nothing; its timezone is always the
# tenant's; it expires after 30 days unless "expiresAt" is sent (at most 90 days after creation).
#
# Prerequisites:
#   1. pnpm infra:up
#   2. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run migration:run
#   3. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run seed
#   4. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run dev
#   5. pnpm --filter @ikaro/bff run dev
#   6. ENABLE_DEV_AUTH=true in apps/bff/.env.local
#
# REST Client environment: select "local" in VS Code status bar

@customerToken = {{customerLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
@staffToken    = {{staffLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
@alertId       = {{createWeeklyAlert.response.body.id}}

###
# @name customerLogin
POST {{bffUrl}}/v1/auth/dev-login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "cliente@email.com.br", "tenantSlug": "{{tenantSlug}}", "type": "customer" }

###
# @name staffLogin
POST {{bffUrl}}/v1/auth/dev-login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "staff@lavacar.com.br", "tenantSlug": "{{tenantSlug}}", "type": "staff" }

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HAPPY PATH — create, list, edit, cancel
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

###

### Create a weekly-preference alert → 201
# @name createWeeklyAlert
POST {{bffUrl}}/v1/availability-alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceId": "{{serviceId}}",
  "criteriaType": "WEEKLY_PREFERENCE",
  "weekdays": ["tuesday", "thursday"],
  "localStartTime": "18:00",
  "localEndTime": "20:00",
  "durationMinutes": 120,
  "participantCount": 2
}

###

### Create a one-time-range alert → 201
POST {{bffUrl}}/v1/availability-alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceId": "{{serviceId}}",
  "criteriaType": "ONE_TIME_RANGE",
  "acceptableStartAt": "2026-10-12T14:00:00.000Z",
  "acceptableEndAt": "2026-10-12T18:00:00.000Z"
}

###

### My alerts → 200 { items }
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/availability-alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

###

### Edit — change only the weekdays → 200
PATCH {{bffUrl}}/v1/availability-alerts/{{alertId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "weekdays": ["friday"] }

###

### Cancel → 200 { id, status: "CANCELLED" } (idempotent)
DELETE {{bffUrl}}/v1/availability-alerts/{{alertId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ERROR PATHS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

###

### ERROR — empty weekday list → 400
POST {{bffUrl}}/v1/availability-alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceId": "{{serviceId}}",
  "criteriaType": "WEEKLY_PREFERENCE",
  "weekdays": [],
  "localStartTime": "18:00",
  "localEndTime": "20:00"
}

###

### ERROR — empty PATCH body → 400
PATCH {{bffUrl}}/v1/availability-alerts/{{alertId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### ERROR — STAFF token → 403
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/availability-alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
